The calendar now includes a user-configurable To Tomorrow Program. Users can open Programs from the user menu, edit program rows with a name, HH:mm activation time, and enabled flag, and save those settings per profile. When the connected session clock reaches an enabled program time, the app activates the tomorrow program parameter, moves only today's incomplete events to tomorrow, leaves completed and non-today events unchanged, and closes the session with the required activation message. The behavior is covered by focused store tests and documented with a TLA+ abstraction-level contract.
